    <Major></Major>
    <Description>No to minimal recoil for mozzie p10 with telescopic scope.
2160x1440 rez 165hz
use 16:10 aspect ratio 
any fov but 90 works best

attachments (required): extended barrel, angled grip, telescopic scope.
note: you need angled grip and extended barrel or else there will be negative recoil!!!</Description>
